s the solution curve at the points $(-2,1)$ and $(-3,0)$.\n\nBased on the above analysis, the solution curve intersects $y=x+2$ exactly at two points, and it does not intersect $y=(x+3)^{2}$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $\\boxed{\\text{B}}$."
