          "question": "How many $3 \\times 3$ matrices $M$ with entries from $\\{0,1,2\\}$ are there, for which the sum of the diagonal entries of $M^{T} M$ is $5 ?$\n\n[A] 126\n\n[B] 198\n\n[C] 162\n\n[D] 135",
