roaches 1 from the left, the limit of $f(x)$ is 0.\n   - As $x$ approaches 1 from the right, the limit of $f(x)$ is also 0.\n   - Therefore, the limit of $f(x)$ as $x$ approaches 1 does not exist.\n\nFinal Answer:\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{B and C}}\n\\]",
